1	/*
2	 * End-to-end on the lab machine: real hub + real camd (with the
3	 * fake-rpicam-still.sh stand-in for the camera), and this test playing the
4	 * part of pird by sending PIR edge messages over the hub socket. The live
5	 * demo uses the real pird and rpicam-still on the Pi; this checks the
6	 * pipeline and storage around them.
7	 *
8	 * test_sound_to_storage plays micd the same way: steady fan-like frames that
9	 * must not trigger, then one clap frame that must open a SOUND_ONLY event.
10	 *
11	 * Fusion (DESIGN.md Section 4): motion alone and sound alone are logged but
12	 * take no images. test_entry_to_storage plays both pird and micd: a PIR rise
13	 * and a clap within T_co make an ENTRY, the only kind that fires the camera.
14	 */
